SUMMARY:St. Mike's Annual Book Sale 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Friends of the Kelly Library’s annual book sale\, featuring a wide selection of gently used books and other materials across academic and popular subjects. Proceeds from the sale support the collections\, spaces\, and services of the John M. Kelly Library.
