UID:10007558-1795003200-1795006800@stmikes.utoronto.ca
SUMMARY:Hope in Action: Building Hope: Reimagining Institutions for Human Flourishing (Continuing Education Free Webinar)
DESCRIPTION:In a time of precarity\, fragmentation\, burnout\, and democratic uncertainty\, what would be possible if we stepped outside of the constrictions of scarcity and austerity and oriented toward abundance to reimagine how our public-serving higher education institutions can be places where hope can become a force for collective renewal? \n\n\n\nIn this webinar\, Dr. Jessica Riddell (professor of Early Modern Literature at Bishop’s University and founder of the Hope Circuits Institute) will join Dr. David Sylvester (President and Vice-Chancellor of the University of St. Michael’s College) to discuss the transformative role that hope plays in building vibrant institutions.  \n\n\n\nDrawing on her work with the Hope Circuits Institute and her forthcoming book\, Hope Circuits Illuminated: Conversations with Luminaries Amid Collapse\, Dr. Riddell will share practical tools\, reflections and insights from engaging in thousands of hours of conversations with scholars\, students\, presidents\, staff\, artists\, and public thinkers to explore how public educational institutions can reclaim their civic purpose and embrace the complexity of our world to imagine new futures. \n\n\n\nPart of the Hope in Action speaker series from USMC CE\n\n\n\nJoin Continuing Education at the University of St. Michael’s College for a free speaker series exploring how hope becomes action in sustainability\, leadership\, social impact\, spirituality\, education\, technology\, and the arts. \n\n\n\nHope is not wishful thinking. It is the decision to engage with our world’s most urgent challenges and work toward meaningful change \, from climate and culture to how we live our values in our workplaces and communities. \n\n\n\nHope in Action brings together innovators\, faculty\, alumni\, and leaders who are meeting urgent challenges with clarity\, courage\, and purpose. \n\n\n\nCome to be inspired. Leave ready to act.
URL:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/event/hope-in-action-building-hope-reimagining-institutions-for-human-flourishing-continuing-education-free-webinar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/nov-HIA.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Continuing Education at the University of St. Michael's College in the University of Toronto":MAILTO:ce.stmikes@utoronto.ca
END:VEVENT
